    "text": "```json\n{\n  \"semantic_type\": \"flow\",\n  \"unit\": \"USD\",\n  \"additive_over_entities\": true,\n  \"additive_over_time\": false,\n  \"time_rollup\": \"reported_fy_value\",\n  \"valid_methods\": [\"sum_across_entities\", \"ratio_of_sums\", \"pct_change\"],\n  \"period_basis\": \"mixed\",\n  \"derivation\": \"Value of the XBRL revenue concept (Revenues or RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax, shown in the concept column) as reported in 10-Q and 10-K filings. Rows hold discrete quarters (Q), cumulative year-to-date amounts (YTD6, YTD9) and full-year amounts (FY), so rows overlap in time.\",\n  \"calendar\": \"fiscal\",\n  \"seasonal_adjustment\": null,\n  \"annualized\": false,\n  \"entity_grain\": \"company (ticker/cik) x reporting period\",\n  \"hierarchy\": null,\n  \"comparability\": \"by_definition_id\",\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"source\": \"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts API\",\n    \"url_template\": \"https://data.sec.gov/api/xbrl/companyfacts/CIK{cik}.json\",\n    \"retrieved_on\": \"2026-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Reported revenue in USD for restaurant companies (CMG, DRI, WING, YUM), taken from SEC XBRL filings. It is a flow measure, and companies' values can be summed across entities for the same period and period_basis. The column mixes quarterly, YTD6, YTD9 and full-year rows, so summing over time double-counts. For an annual figure use the reported FY row, or rebuild quarters from the cumulative rows. Compare percentage changes only between rows with the same period_basis. Companies may tag revenue with different XBRL concepts, so check the concept column before comparing.\"\n}\n```",
